You have encountered the tower levels.  There are three of them, and the
entrance to the tower is on the bottom level of the tower.  To enter,
simply go back down and explore the level(s) below until you find a similar
central configuration with an entrance.  There are some fun goodies in
the tower, but you do have to deal with bunches of vampires, so be sure
you have a good AC!

